title: Change of Heart
text: One straight beam lights white, then cyan. Nothing stands between them.
trick: a tangler's twin changes colour in mid-flight: filter the other twin to red and shift it, close enough to the tangler, and the near twin loses red after it has passed the white target
motif: open field; the laser points straight at the blue target as a decoy
ink: 1
expect: recolours>=2
proof: not proved; no other solution found in 300 s
